OL,3,ANandy rejects claims of politicising
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday after Erasmus row
OL,5,
OL,6,FCulture Secretary Lisa Nandy has
OL,7,Frejected accusations of politicising
OL,8,FRemembrance Sunday after being
OL,9,Fcriticised for linking the event to the
OL,10,FUK rejoining the European Union's
OL,11,FErasmus scheme.
OL,13,FHer department announced on Saturday
OL,14,Fnight that "as we mark Remembrance
OL,15,FSunday, Erasmus+ will give a new
OL,16,Fgeneration the chance to build
OL,17,Fconnections across Europe".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
