OL,3,ADense fog threatens Monday morning
OL,4,Arush-hour disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office has issued a yellow
OL,7,Fwarning for dense fog across much of
OL,8,FEngland and eastern Wales running until
OL,9,F11:00 on Monday. A separate yellow fog
OL,10,Fwarning has also been issued for
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland and runs until 10:00.
OL,12,FSee warning details here.
OL,14,FThe larger fog warning for England and
OL,15,FWales covers an area of the southern UK
OL,16,Fstretching from Canterbury to Cardiff,
OL,17,FHull to St Asaph and Southampton to
OL,18,FYork, and includes London, Birmingham
OL,19,Fand parts of Greater Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
