OL,3,AWoman says Al Fayed's brother drugged
OL,4,Aand sexually abused her at Highland
OL,5,Aestate
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking for the first time about the
OL,8,Fabuse that took place in Scotland, Jill
OL,9,Fsaid she was flown on the Fayed
OL,10,Ffamily's private jet to Balnagown,
OL,11,Ftheir estate in Easter Ross, where she
OL,12,Fwas repeatedly assaulted.
OL,14,FShe is one of hundreds of women who
OL,15,Fhave alleged abuse by the Fayed
OL,16,Fbrothers.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
