OL,5,Alife, colleague says
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Sunday, the officers - both hailed
OL,8,Fas "true heroes" by the prime minister
OL,9,Ffor preventing further deaths - emerged
OL,10,Ffrom comas.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
